		{"id":"6008249d0a8a7693","type":"text","text":"Choose [[Feathering]] correctly: Optimal Window\n\n- Avoid seams\n\t- window = size of largest prominent feature\n- avoid ghosting\n\t- window $\\leq 2 \\times$ size of smallest prominent feature \n","x":-3795,"y":8085,"width":475,"height":209},
		{"id":"1acaa9b4e86db17e","type":"text","text":"# Multiple Alpha Blending\n\n## Blending semi-transparent sprites\n$$I_{\\text{composition}} = \\alpha_a A + (1-\\alpha_a) \\alpha_b B$$\n$$\\alpha_{\\text{composition}} = \\alpha_a + (1-\\alpha_a) \\alpha_b$$\n\n## premultiplied\n$im(\\alpha R, \\alpha G, \\alpha_B, \\alpha)$\n$$I_{\\text{composition}} = A + (1-\\alpha_a) B$$\n\n[[Alpha-Channel]] #CompositionAndBlending\n","x":-3980,"y":7532,"width":440,"height":484},
